          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Expansion or threat of targeted sanctions on technology exports and firms creates immediate ambiguity about permissible suppliers, cross‑border data flows, and compliance obligations, increasing uncertainty about future rules governing AI and data‑centre activity." />
