          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Intensified sanctions against Iran prompt the US and partners to expand export-licensing rules, tighten secondary-sanctions compliance, and broaden controlled item lists—measures that are applied to flows involving Chinese firms and thus raise outbound/export control stringency." />
