          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Shortfalls or volatility in fuel/electricity supplies raise projected operating risk and backup‑power needs for energy‑intensive data centres, prompting lenders and financiers to charge higher all‑in borrowing costs." />
