          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Repeated or anticipated energy disruptions increase expected OPEX and risk for cloud/AI providers, lowering expected returns and causing investors to reduce appetite for AI‑linked assets." />
