          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased Chinese state‑directed investment in regional ports, terminals, and logistics infrastructure expands Beijing's commercial and operational footprint at maritime chokepoints, producing new ownership, access patterns and dependencies that raise the risk of contestation or interdiction in a US–Iran crisis." />
