          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sudden tightening of export/outbound controls disrupts trade and investment flows and slows near‑term growth prospects, leading market participants to lower their expectations for future policy rates." />
