          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="If China demonstrably tightens and enforces outbound export controls on technology flows to Iran or known intermediary firms, US policy makers face reduced political and evidentiary pressure to expand sanctions, lowering aggregate sanctions intensity." />
